<title>FRANCE: France Telecom sells Info AG in MBO.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sells Info AG in MBO.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom SA said it had sold its 98.19 percent-owned German unit Info AG to its management for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The sale of Info AG was a condition imposed by the European Union for approval of the Atlas joint venture with Deutsche Telekom AG.</p>
<p>Atlas comprises the European activities of a three-way link-up with Sprint Corp of the U.S. in GlobalOne, a global telecommunciations service for companies.</p>
</text>
